- #link("https://www.racedepartment.com/downloads/rallylegends-mod-combo-vw-polo-r-wrc-v-1-0-new-rx-track-kouvola-by-ultranew_b.8302/")[VW Polo R WRC] — Part of the RallyLegends series of WRC and rallycross cars (search for all entries by UltraNew_B on RaceDepartment).
