=== Wave 1 Tracks — Rallycross & Test

- #link("https://www.racedepartment.com/downloads/holjesrx.13849/")[Holjes Rallycross] — The "Magic Weekend" venue in Sweden. Mixed-surface RX track with huge elevation changes and the iconic Velodrome corner.
- #link("https://www.racedepartment.com/downloads/karelia-cross.5275/")[Karelia Cross] — Finnish-style rallycross circuit. Gravel and asphalt mix.
